    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“We move, but we do not break.”</em></p><p>As a <strong>bonus action</strong>, you can mark one ally within <strong>6 squares</strong> who can see or hear you.</p><ul><li>Until the start of your next turn, that ally gains a <strong>+1 bonus to Guard</strong> and a <strong>+1 bonus to all defense check against being Shaken or charmed</strong>.</li><li>If they succeed on any such save while this bonus is active, they also gain <strong>temporary Integrity equal to your tier</strong>.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, regaining all expended uses when you finish a <strong>a Soma Break</strong>.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
